    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20986" root="سنه" body-key="s">
    
      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سانههُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَانَهَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِنَاهٌ</span>; and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَاناهُ</span>,
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَانَاةٌ</span>; (K;) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَامَلَهُ مُسُانَهَةً</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَانَاةً</span>;
(Msb;) <i>He made an engagement,</i> or <i>a contract,
with him for work</i> or <i>the like, by the year:</i> (K:)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَأْجَرْتُهُ مُسَانَهَةً</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَانَاةً</span>, [<i>I hired him by
the year:</i>] (S:) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَانَهَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَانَاةٌ</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السَّنَةُ</span> are
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعَاوَمَةٌ</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العَامُ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُشَاهَرَةٌ</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الشَّهْرُ</span>, and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُرَابَعَةٌ</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الرَّبِيعُ</span>, &amp;c. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ربع</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سانهت النَّخْلَةُ</span> <i>The palm-tree bore one year and
not another;</i> (As, K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاوَمَت</span>. (As, TA.)

